                                "sense_id": "2044609a-1ff1-3fcf-a3db-843ba1458523",
                                "text": "\"Bibble Box,\" \" Broad-leaf Box,\" or \" Peppermint Box.\" Useful for fencing purposes, &c. Strong and durable. Habitat, open forests and low flats. Plentiful in some localities. Flowering period varies."
