                                "sense_id": "2044609a-1ff1-3fcf-a3db-843ba1458523",
                                "text": "The timber on the estate consists of white and bibble box, apple tree, red gum, ironbark, pine, and river oak. There are about 2,695 acres of dense pine scrub, interspersed with many of the natural scrubs and trees peculiar to[…]"
